        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px);letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:640;margin:12px 0 0;">Your 5-hour &amp; weekly limits, always one glance away.</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:16px;margin:14px 0 0;line-height:1.6;">Exact when you're signed in, a clearly-degraded estimate when you're not — never a confident number that might be wrong. A predictive nudge tells you <span class="mono" style="color:var(--ink)">≈2h to your cap</span> before the wall, not after.</p>
