<!-- TRUST -->
<section class="trust" id="trust">
  <div class="wrap">
    <svg class="lock" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="10.5" width="14" height="9" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
    <h2>It audits and optimizes — it never becomes the engine.</h2>
    <p>Throttle reads <span class="mono">~/.claude</span> on your Mac and stays out of the way. 100% local — <strong>no telemetry, no analytics, no account</strong>: your prompts, code and usage never leave the machine. Signed &amp; notarized, auto-updates via Sparkle; uninstall cleanly any time and every change reverts.</p>
  </div>
</section>

